  "definition": "Classification of Funds",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-11-15",
  "historyNote": "#4940, eff 9-25-90; ss by #6335, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1705); ss by #8179, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10214, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13489, eff 11-15-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700)",
